                <syl /><neume facs="#m-08001b2e-7497-4b5a-8148-57578d99ac49" type="punctum" xml:id="m-bbc97423-b320-45bb-9e88-1bb6c508fecb">
                  <nc xml:id="m-5427e24a-ac22-433f-90a3-948b529b1fe6" pname="g" oct="3" tilt="se" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-0f307ef4-6720-4afe-9340-7ddf4216ca0f">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-caa88bf0-8f39-4089-9751-b351f12bf311" type="punctum" xml:id="m-ba388762-d227-4381-be04-78bbd540d5a1">
                  <nc xml:id="m-e68dfaa9-5c05-471a-8dda-8f096b0b891c" pname="f" oct="3" tilt="se" /></neume></syllable><divLine xml:id="m-1487e5ed-56d8-44c5-a11d-be14f020101a" facs="#m-38702c4e-e544-4342-8d2c-cef1159450b1" form="finalis" /><syllable xml:id="m-d6be6827-da7d-49a7-b015-b6563a7972f8">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-651ac16a-dcef-4f0a-bdfe-3fdeef02c335" type="punctum" xml:id="m-0ba51914-8e4c-4996-b25f-c516f964e9a9">
                  <nc xml:id="m-3bc1a710-0630-48f6-99d0-860fe2f8abb5" pname="g" oct="3">
                    <signifLet xml:id="m-918230aa-daf5-49a1-aaed-1e6f316d613f" /></nc></neume></syllable></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-5d9e3c22-1703-4eb5-87a7-ed524ff1ee0c">
            <lg xml:id="m-a3f94861-4236-404b-8fec-dfb832df0a53">
              <l xml:id="m-c376a42b-1649-4d2e-972d-4dc446002d8a" facs="#m-b8857b2c-e038-40a5-9880-5d8d0853c0b7" label="ambiguous">February 12.</l><l xml:id="m-c5e9c880-f888-4c6f-a5ff-a5ec68c903f3" facs="#m-fd02a1b6-1887-4017-badd-f1d7c2ac1609" label="ambiguous">1385</l><l xml:id="m-2e00e55c-51eb-4b88-86ca-02f7a849b3e7" facs="#m-0eb4cc11-c088-45dd-aabd-75fc5b97726d" label="lyrics-like">tú- um, et victrí-cem má¬ num tú¬ am laudavé¬ runt</l><l xml:id="m-3ae2bcda-3ef4-4948-a411-58a955ed47ba" facs="#m-d1bc9ff9-39a5-4048-8167-233096f802c0" label="lyrics-like">pá-ri-ter: quóni-am sa-pi- énti-a</l><l xml:id="m-7133e275-9e22-46c3-be06-46a2108fd772" facs="#m-76851d9a-41df-492b-9049-3dcfc0761976" label="lyrics-like">a-pé- ru- it os</l><l xml:id="m-1cef6203-2cb5-4771-af33-f3ac4ab7ec42" facs="#m-e2e0e656-9764-419c-842c-33d5a34305c8" label="lyrics-like">mú- tum, et línguas infánti-um fé-cit di¬ sér¬</l><l xml:id="m-0a19cf7f-73b4-47c5-9388-dd52f902d02d" facs="#m-0bcc68dc-e0d4-4491-9aa3-05369d615ee0" label="lyrics-like">tas. Ps. Dómine Dóminus nóster: “quam admi-rábi-le</l><l xml:id="m-33d50f33-4e84-470f-9e48-16e63104259b" facs="#m-da02a1b3-0481-48d7-a95c-8a3c6404f6c7" label="lyrics-like">est nómen tú-um in univérsa térra! Gló-ri-a Pátri.</l><l xml:id="m-50829f8d-e7eb-4626-a938-39a21f66ecc1" facs="#m-56c8dee9-c4cc-4161-85c5-e2c16fc411b2" label="ambiguous">Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-1b9af50d-46f5-4124-a91c-4080418b3010" facs="#m-8e0aa121-8463-49b0-bbd6-79b276833deb" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-669d1ef0-d880-401c-837b-242da860a669" facs="#m-60a47b3b-ee4a-4387-9f3b-4723a25cf5dd" label="lyrics-like">Omine Jesu Christe, qui ad re- fecundásti: t concéde propitius;</l><l xml:id="m-2c6f33a5-9580-44cc-8027-e4722d5d7999" facs="#m-5c0e3a93-3454-419a-a623-e347efd712b8" label="lyrics-like">I coléndãm memóriam dolórum lita nos eórum consociári flétibus.</l><l xml:id="m-afac4701-b632-4ae5-adfc-4bb08b0fec8a" facs="#m-38beb81d-d264-4255-8d00-802c9a6c258c" label="lyrics-like">ut perfruámur et gáudiis : Qui vivis</l><l xml:id="m-7c7b9f94-80fa-4ab1-94c6-0c8a8adae3fd" facs="#m-cac95728-8a3f-4833-a5a2-7e6f6f186927" label="lyrics-like">sanctíssimae Genitricis tuae, per</l><l xml:id="m-e2d43380-a3d4-4bb4-a5c4-3ab39a6e87f1" facs="#m-2d78cfae-2c3d-47bb-81e1-6a84cbc0b5f9" label="ambiguous">et regnas.</l><l xml:id="m-f5291a02-9a64-4197-a4f6-4e0722bcc46d" facs="#m-969b2991-59f6-4fdc-b210-db280c72ff61" label="lyrics-like">septem beátos Patres nova Servó¬</l><l xml:id="m-7bc90ae4-5938-468c-8ed9-14919e30c555" facs="#m-d08783ca-73c4-443e-95de-c4da1a94e8b8" label="lyrics-like">rum ejus familia Ecclésiam tuam</l><l xml:id="m-67aecffb-ea6b-43a6-9980-7b992ea11567" facs="#m-4f1cec6d-260e-4834-8aed-1008ed0246d8" label="ambiguous">Lectio libri Sapientiæ. Eccli. 44.</l><l xml:id="m-d527d5b7-cf95-41a6-ba59-3e4d10995d83" facs="#m-ebdb2053-b430-4081-9ad1-a1449e400fa2" label="lyrics-like">Audémus viros gloriósos, et pa¬ stúdium habéntes: pacificántes in</l><l xml:id="m-e6334119-c645-440e-a3d3-e34fa3c70376" facs="#m-a0df316c-d6d9-423d-8875-ee506f341603" label="lyrics-like">II réntes nostros in generatiône] dómibus suis. Omnes isti in genera¬</l><l xml:id="m-e3a5e5e9-864f-49d5-a7b1-4b58794a2fe2" facs="#m-0814e768-9218-424c-94b2-a0ac69fa3293" label="lyrics-like">sua. Muitam glóriam fecit Dómi-[tiónibus gentis suae glóriam adépti</l><l xml:id="m-67dfc3cd-111b-4166-a934-3094b4c7e53f" facs="#m-88779d14-d984-4442-84c3-ea7230ba8755" label="lyrics-like">sunt, et in diébus suis habéntur in</l><l xml:id="m-f6788e35-1348-41ca-add5-b9ecaead6d39" facs="#m-b0b2bd17-1a36-48a8-b123-356c21eac4d8" label="lyrics-like">nus magnificéntia sua a saéculo.</l><l xml:id="m-1a0ec467-1fbc-4feb-af69-4703001cb3cd" facs="#m-56f9d012-1ad0-40dc-952a-6119fb9a51da" label="lyrics-like">láudibus. Qui de illis nati sunt,</l><l xml:id="m-d50fd516-7a10-4a6b-a0df-bfabd7b53d55" facs="#m-5301322a-1839-4c51-bcce-b34ea1c05a6c" label="lyrics-like">Dominántes in potestátibus suis, hó¬</l><l xml:id="m-3e354c99-b475-42ef-8ccb-7fef6080590f" facs="#m-c459f4a7-cbb9-4eb0-9c88-2e3360682d39" label="lyrics-like">reliquérunt nomen narrándi laudes</l><l xml:id="m-f8548c91-55cb-4fff-95e7-3dc498cc4fbc" facs="#m-725bd849-e441-4798-a394-72b8538305f4" label="lyrics-like">mines magni virtúte, et prudéntia</l><l xml:id="m-36460f67-1224-443d-9031-ea205779b65f" facs="#m-68965dbf-678b-4401-b574-9f14c483278a" label="lyrics-like">eórum. Et sunt quorum non est</l><l xml:id="m-173fd063-be45-4c58-bb51-1c1cdcc02d4b" facs="#m-bf87c648-5849-40c5-bee5-65ecdbc57f23" label="lyrics-like">sua praéditi, nuntiántes in pro¬</l><l xml:id="m-0f2a81a3-c506-4cab-a729-1f0e92d7c6e7" facs="#m-fb8323b0-1848-4535-a65a-2e2a63990934" label="lyrics-like">memória: periérunt quasi qui non</l><l xml:id="m-6b6174b6-9e73-44bf-bd0d-50100237c236" facs="#m-9fe656b1-40e6-44cb-bebe-4b7d2472ddd1" label="lyrics-like">phétis dignitátem prophetárum, et</l><l xml:id="m-3f090c19-130d-4044-b456-3c96b965018f" facs="#m-2c91492b-0ab8-4fd9-818e-c4947836f14b" label="lyrics-like">imperántes in praesénti pópulo, et lfúerint: et nati sunt, quasi non</l><l xml:id="m-1702500b-b1bc-4b4b-84fd-5c5e4659831b" facs="#m-d6cee0fe-9f81-4d47-9d1c-62d489c9eaa6" label="lyrics-like">nati, et fllii ipsórum cum ipsis. Sed</l><l xml:id="m-db24a04e-c6dc-47af-a12d-321a8e962fb1" facs="#m-73fad91f-0da9-4bb7-b14d-9292cc0132e3" label="lyrics-like">virtúte prudéntiae pópulis sanctis¬</l><l xml:id="m-48fcb459-598f-4d4f-b46f-59d0eb398a73" facs="#m-5a51e804-149c-4b30-913d-0bd88f4a300f" label="lyrics-like">illi viri misericórdiae sunt, quorum</l><l xml:id="m-3cb9f5da-2d51-4db5-b680-374d1344a8ff" facs="#m-0860ca73-b856-495b-9b20-5eb849e7fc89" label="ambiguous">sima verba. In peritia sua requi¬</l><l xml:id="m-d6bb8b34-64ec-4154-8a1d-4106760792fe" facs="#m-c7236f20-4534-4dbe-9b71-bddb3acc33b8" label="lyrics-like">pietátes non defuérunt. Cum sémine</l><l xml:id="m-4a7e5fd0-0ff3-453d-9c1d-405598159b3a" facs="#m-278fba70-a7af-4949-bebe-e4848ac67fb0" label="lyrics-like">réntes modos músicos, et narrántes</l><l xml:id="m-6f112f8d-e5a7-46fa-b25a-c1c954c61df1" facs="#m-45b7bfad-a408-44f2-9e91-633f94f6a9d3" label="lyrics-like">eórum pérmanent bona, haeréditas</l><l xml:id="m-34635781-60d3-4fea-9b4a-abfe2270e76a" facs="#m-49d29da8-b0da-4e00-9e55-1f997c72e355" label="lyrics-like">cármina scripturárum. Hómines</l><l xml:id="m-9f1c9b89-3c18-433d-a79e-4094d3b17cff" facs="#m-8525372c-2b1b-4483-ae94-f8231c8ce710" label="lyrics-like">divites in virtúte, pulchritúdinis! sancta nepótes eórum, et in testa¬</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>